# secret_scan allowlist: "path-glob | rule | reason". The reason is mandatory.
# Keep this minimal. Never allowlist a real credential: rotate it instead.
ONBOARDING.md | password-assignment | Documents the throwaway local-dev SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD for the Docker Postgres on a laptop; never used against a hosted service.
scripts/dsn-label.test.sh | db-url-password | Fake DSNs (FAKESECRET etc.) used to prove dsn-label.sh never prints a password; no real credential.
